    "public_api_change": "ADDITIVE",
    "schema_diff_summary": "keys.rs has one test module named tests. Add the new test function at the end of that module, before its closing brace. Do not write a second mod tests. Change only the cmd arm of normalize_binding. Add command and meta to that or-pattern. Do not add a second arm that also sets cmd. Two match arms with the same body are clippy::match_same_arms.  Do not write two if arms that return the same value. Combine them with ||. That is clippy::if_same_then_else. Do not touch edit_binding, text_binding, or move_binding. The shift-tab arm stays. The existing tests modifier_order_is_ctrl_alt_shift_cmd and ctrl_s_saves stay green. Do not rewrite their assertions. The test meta_and_command_are_cmd checks command_for_binding of meta-s is Command::Save. command_for_binding of command-s is Command::Save. normalize_binding of meta-shift-z is shift-cmd-z. Branch from the current tip of main. base_sha records that tip at planning time. If main has moved, use the new tip. Keep the change under about 60 lines. Stay inside this one behavior. Run the full test module named in the commands, not only the new test."
  },
